Pilots"}," of each vessel. Failing the check by 10 or more results in a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Collision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Collision"}," between the ships.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
